\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6.5}{\ignorespaces The simulated hourly median follows the observed pattern but misses its peaks. Supplementary diagnostic, median turnaround time per Gate-In hour in the test period (seed 42).}}{88}{figure.caption.41}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6.6}{\ignorespaces Under load, the simulated approach rises as observed, while the stops and the turnaround time rise too little. Test period solid, training period dotted.}}{88}{figure.caption.42}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6.7}{\ignorespaces All rules lower the frequency of hours above the corridor, but with 20\,\% more trucks their effect on the severity is not determined and the wider rules lengthen the visits at the receiving blocks. Changes against the baseline of the same seed and demand, means over ten seeds with 95\,\% $t$-intervals.}}{95}{figure.caption.46}%
